{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07443","headline":"闻虞沔州有替将归上都登汉东城寄赠 · 刘长卿","name":"闻虞沔州有替将归上都登汉东城寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南摇落客心悲，溳水悠悠怨别离。\n早鴈初辞旧关塞，秋风先入古城池。\n腰章建隼皇恩赐，露冕临人白发垂。\n惆怅恨君先我去，汉阳耆老忆旌麾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}